        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "> nice! is anything blocking us from hosting the result on https://neovim.io/ (static website) ? just curious.\r\n\r\nYes, the demo needs `Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy` and `Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy` before browsers expose `SharedArrayBuffer`.  But, Ig we could add the `coi-serviceworker` shim to spoof the headers client-side or host the demo on a platform that supports custom headers and link to it from neovim.io. ",
